     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The gender-oriented analysis conducted and a package of specialized financial statements for the preparation of financial accounts prepared.</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">There is a need to develop a package of specialized gender-sensitive reporting intended exclusively for the purposes of compiling a financial account, since the current financial statements do not meet the coverage of transactions with financial instruments and sectoral sections indicating the movement of these financial flows.The package of this specialized reporting will include both reports on transactions with financial instruments and their movement by sector, carried out by institutional units of the financial sector, non-financial corporations, the household sector, government agencies, and the rest of the world. This will be a very significant information package, but its formation and the creation of appropriate templates will allow the country to make a significant step forward - to compile a financial account that will act as the necessary corrective basis in the calculations of GDP in the real sector.It is expected that the analysis and the entire reporting package will be developed by a national consultant assisted by an international consultant, along with consultations of specialists from the Statistical Institute and the Central Bank of one of the countries with advanced experience in compiling a financial account, who will visit Turkmenistan.</narrative>
